  "question": "What\u2019s the nearest restaurant you\u2019d reach going toward Ink 48 Hotel, New York, NY from Nohra Haime Gallery, New York, NY?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005499 40.746428)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.995886 40.764515)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005499 40.746428)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.005499 40.746428)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
